{
  "id": "ACT.5",
  "number": "5",
  "bookId": "ACT",
  "reference": "Mase 5",
  "verseCount": 42,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "5",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "5",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ya Ananiya ni Safila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu jwine soni, lina lyakwe Ananiya pampepe ni Safila ŵamkwakwe, ŵasumisye mgunda wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwakupikanganana ni ŵamkwawo, ŵasapwile mbiya sine kuti siŵe syawo siŵapatile ku mgundawo, ni ŵapelece syakusigala kwa ŵandumetume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Petulo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵatite, “Ananiya, ligongo cici Satana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " agumbele mu mtima mwenu mpaka kumlambusya Msimu Ŵaswela pakusapula mbiya sine sya mgunda wenu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pimwaliji mkanimsumisye, ana nganiwuŵa wenu? Nipo mli msumisye, ana mbiyasyo nganisiŵa myala mwenu? Nambi mwakundile uli yeleyi mu mtima mwenu? Pelepa nganimwalambusya ŵandu, nambo mumlambwisye Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene maloŵe gelaga Ananiya, ŵagwile pasi ni ŵawile. Nipo ŵandu wosope ŵiŵapikene yeleyi wakamwile woga mnope. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni acacanda ŵayice ni ŵamŵijilile nguwo ni ŵapite kukwasika mwilembe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Palipapite ma awala gatatu, ŵamkwawo ŵajinjile m'nyumbamo ali ngakumanyilila yele yiyatendekwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petulo ŵawusisye kuti, “Musalile, ana mgundawo pamo ni ŵamkwenu mwasumisye mbiya syakwe ni asi?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵakongwewo ŵajanjile kuti, “Elo, mbiya syakwe ni syelesi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo Petulo ŵamsalile kuti, “Ligongo cici mwapangene ni ŵamkwenu kulinga Msimu wa Ambuje? Mlole, ŵandu ŵiŵapite kukwasika ŵamkwenu mwilembe ali pa mlangopa, nipo jemanja pejo tamjigale nomwe ŵakwe kuja kukumsika mwilembe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Papopo Safila wagwilile pasi pa sajo sya Petulo ni ŵawile. Piŵajinjile acacanda ŵala, ŵasimene ali awile kala. Ni ŵanyakwile kuja kukwasika mwilembe pakuŵandikana ni ŵamkwawowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo mpingo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni ŵandu wosope ŵele ŵiŵapikene yeleyi, wakamwile woga mnope.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandumetume ŵatendaga yimanyisyo ni yakusimonjesya yejinji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandumetume ŵaliji mkutenda yimanyisyo ni yakusimonjesya yejinji pasikati pa ŵandu wosope ŵiŵakulupilile Klistu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵasonganaga mwa mtima wakupikanganana mwipenu lya Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwa ŵandu ŵanewo paliji pangali atamose mundu jumo juŵalimbile mtima kuŵa nawo pampepe, nambope ŵandu wosope ŵalapililaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵakulupililaga mwa Ambuje ŵatupilagatupilga mwakuti lyaliji likuga lyalikulungwa lya acalume ni acakongwe wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo lya yiŵatendaga ŵandumetume ŵala, ŵandu ŵakopwece ni ŵakulwala wawo kuja nawo ku misewo, ni kwagonekaga myindanda ni m'mikeka kuti Petulo pakupita ciwulili cakwepeco cayicile ŵakulwalawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwasonganaga ŵandu ŵajinji ŵakutyocela ku misi jakusyungulila Yelusalemu. Ŵaliji ali ŵajigele ŵakulwala ni ŵane ŵiŵaliji ni msimu wakusakala wosopewo ŵaposile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŵandumetume ŵalasile",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo jwamkulungwa jwaŵakutaga mbopesi ni wosope ŵele ŵiŵaliji nawo, ni ŵa mlikuga lya Asaduki,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wosope ŵaliji ŵawiwu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo ŵakamwile ŵandumetume ŵala ni ŵaŵisile m'nyumba ja akayidi wamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo cilo lilayika lya Ambuje lyawugwile milango josope ja nyumbajo nipo ŵandumetume ŵala ŵakopwece. Ŵasalile kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mjawule ni mkajime m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE ni kwasalila ŵandu wosope maloŵe gosope gakwayana ni umi wasambanowu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandumetume ŵala piŵapikene yeleyi, ŵajinjile m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE kundaŵindaŵipe nipo ŵatandite kwiganya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice jwamkulungwa jwaŵakutaga mbopesi pampepe ni wosope ŵiŵaliji nawo, ŵaŵilasile ŵanganya jajikulungwa, ni nganya josope ja acakulungwa ja Aisalaeli. Nipo ŵatumile acikapitawo kuti ajawule ku nyumba ja akayidi kula kuti akajigale ŵandumetume ŵala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo piŵayice acikapitawo ŵala ku nyumbako, nganiŵasimana ŵandumetumewo, ni ŵawusile kuja kwasalila acitiji, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Pitwayice ku nyumba ja acikaidijo, twajisimene jili ciwugalile, nipo acilonda ali cimile m'milango nambo pitwawugwile matanga nganitusimana kose mundu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵapikene yeleyi, jwamkulungwa jwaŵakutaga mbopesi ni jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jwakulondela Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ŵasimonjile ni ŵamasile nayo lunda, ni ŵasoŵile yakutenda ligongo nganamanyililaga yiyawonecele jemanjajo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mundu jwine jwayice kwasalila kuti, “Ŵandu ŵele ŵimwaŵisile m'nyumba ja acikayidi ŵala, ali m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE nipo akwiganya ŵandu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pelepo jwamkulungwa jwa asilikali jula pampepe ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵapite kukwajigala ŵandumetumewo. Nambo nganiŵajigala mwangondo ligongo ŵajogwepe ŵandu kuti tacaponya maganga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice nawo, ŵajimice pameso pa ŵanganya jajikulungwa jila. Nipo jwamkulungwa jwaŵakutaga mbopesi jula jwatandite kwawusya yiwusyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatite, “Nambotu twamgombelecesye kuti mkasijiganya soni mu lina lya Yesu,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nambo jemanja mjenesye yakwiganya yenu mu Yelusalemu mosope, nipo mkusosa kututwika uwe ciwa ca mundu jweleju.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
